---
import RootLayout from "../layouts/RootLayout.astro";

import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.svelte";
---

<RootLayout>
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <Navbar />
    <div class="mx-6 md:mx-12 flex justify-center flex-grow">
      <div class="max-w-5xl w-full">
        <div class="my-8 grid grid-cols-5 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl">
          <p class="col-span-5 lg:col-span-4">
            hey! i'm sam!<br />
            <br />
            currently, i'm...<br />
            - first-year @ university of waterloo<br />
            - running programs & events @ <a
              href="https://hackclub.com"
              target="_blank">hack club</a
            ><br />
            <br />
            i'm excited about...<br />
            - crafting code (i love ruby on rails)<br />
            - robotics, electronics & PCBs<br />
            - bringing people together<br />
            - silly adventures<br />
            - ???<br />
            <br />
            after graduating high school, i took a gap year to run programs & events
            with hack club in vermont, building gamified software platforms and irl
            experiences that get teens to ship technical projects.<br />
            <br />
            a few things i've led @ hack club...<br />
            - <a href="https://youtu.be/dTGFOKblRc4" target="_blank"
              >7-day hardware hackathon</a
            > for 200 teens @ shenzhen, china (<a
              href="https://github.com/hackclub/fallout"
              target="_blank">repo</a
            >)<br />
            - <a href="https://blueprint.hackclub.com" target="_blank"
              >hardware grant program</a
            > with amd, reaching 25,000+ teens (<a
              href="https://github.com/hackclub/blueprint"
              target="_blank">repo</a
            >)<br />
            - <a href="https://blueprint.hackclub.com/prototype" target="_blank"
              >ai & robotics hackathon</a
            > with amd, culminating <a
              href="https://youtu.be/28cWcxYd6Tk"
              target="_blank">on-stage at CES</a
            ><br />
            <br />
            if any of these resonate, <a href="/contact">we should chat</a>!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</RootLayout>
